# Web3Forms access key for the contact form.
# The site code reads PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY (see src/content/pages/contact.mdx).
# Get a key from https://web3forms.com/ and put it in your local .env for development.
# (The key below is the shared dev/test key — replace it with your own if you like.)
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=be0579c5-146b-45ea-b911-1767a935a312

# ── CI (GitHub Actions) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The workflow does NOT read this file. It uses GitHub *variables*
# (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions):
#   PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_GITHUB_KEY  → .github/workflows/deploy.yml (GitHub Pages)
# The workflow injects the variable as PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY at build time.
